      "id": "b-day-scale-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The August 2026 experiments used 2-vCPU workers and reached 32 concurrent claims. The earlier 64-worker quota table and quarter-duty-cycle estimate are not current provider guarantees. "
